sult of this attack  asta is able to break through the devil  fire and devil ice magic  as asta approaches the fused devil liba  inside of asta remembers how he was the  weakest of all the devils on the first  level of the underworld  and he remembers how lilith and ama were  the highest ranking devils  on that same level liebus spent so many  years being bullied and abused by these  highest ranking devils  and at that time he was completely  powerless to do anything to stop them  even if he tried his best he never even  stood a chance against  these devils but now thanks to  anti-magic  and thanks to osta liba is able to stand  up to the fusion of lilith and the mob  and fight against them liebe is  extremely grateful to osta for giving  him this opportunity to stop  lilith and ama an opportunity that he  would have thought impossible  before meeting osta so just like asta  had thanked liba in the past for giving  him the ability to fight and become a  magic knight  liba now thanks asta for everything that  asta has done for him  and this moment really showcases the  fact that asta and liba have an  equal partnership they both depend on  each other  and this partnership is not a one-way  street  and honestly i love seeing the  relationship between these two develop  after learning liba's tragic backstory  i'm so glad that he and asta are  becoming bros  and i think that fighting together  during this arc is going to make their  bond  even stronger but back to the fight  itself this entire experience with asta  and anti-magic is extremely strange to  defuse the devil  and he seems confused and lieben knows  exactly why  this is the case lilith and ama have  always lived as the strongest  devils inside the realm and they were  always the undisputed rulers  of the first floor of the underworld  they lived their entire lives believing  that all a life  exists solely for their own  entertainment and so they are used to  always being in complete control  and dominating e